"Slavoniji i restoran u Münchenu imaju iste probleme — previše papira, "
"previše klikova, premalo vremena."
msgstr ""
"LIMIT Connect was born from a simple frustration: existing ERP systems are "
"too expensive, too complicated, and don't understand the local market. A "
"craftsman in Slavonia and a restaurant in Munich have the same problems — "
"too much paperwork, too many clicks, too little time."

msgid ""
"Zato smo izgradili platformu koja spaja hrvatsku preciznost s njemačkom "
"temeljitošću. Fiskalizacija, e-Račun, POS blagajna, skladište, radni sati, "
"AI asistent — sve u jednom sustavu, s jednim pristupom."
msgstr ""
"That's why we built a platform that combines Croatian precision with German "
"thoroughness. Fiscalization, e-Invoice, POS cash register, warehouse, "
"working hours, AI assistant — all in one system, with one access."

